        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tronix Carnival Games is a third-person shooter (TPS) rogue-like game set in a dystopian world ruled by robots. The story takes place in an old, ruined carnival, once full of life but now controlled by the ancient Tronix robots. Bored with their existence, these robots have turned the park into a deadly game, a cruel challenge for anyone daring to enter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a protagonist seeking to uncover the secrets of the carnival while shaping their own destiny. Each playthrough is a unique exploration, with the goal of venturing as far as possible by visiting attractions, battling hostile robots, and surviving the trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To progress, players can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire and upgrade weapons suited to the challenges ahead.<br>Discover predictions, special powers that influence their playstyle.<br>Collect circus-inspired equipment to enhance their abilities.<br>Between each attempt, resources gathered can be used to restore and upgrade the carnival, unlocking:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops offering items and upgrades for future runs.<br>Special events in the park, altering the rules or providing advantages.<br>Tronix Carnival Games is an adventure blending exploration, customization, and strategy, offering endless replayability in a world that is both captivating and unforgiving.</p>",
